rate threshold)"}, "pnl_gross_pct": 0.04, "repro_cmd": "GCE 32-vCPU europe-west1; python3 scripts/subs60_gridsim2.py --symbols <SYM> --gate --signal model", "setup": "grid_sim TP/SL sweep on the sub-60s substrate under the DEPLOYABLE vol-MODEL gate (no look-ahead: trade when the trained vol logreg predicts opportunity at the train-set realized base-rate threshold). Same 36-config grid + analytic VIP0/maker/taker net as the oracle run; this is the actually-tradeable economics. Dir signal = logreg sign. fill-latency 150ms. Per symbol; mid_paths for gated rows only.", "split_method": "honest_val_test", "status": "exploratory", "symbols": ["BTC-USDT-PERP", "ETH-USDT-PERP", "BNB-USDT-PERP", "SOL-USDT-PERP", "XRP-USDT-PERP", "DOGE-USDT-PERP", "LINK-USDT-PERP", "LTC-USDT-PERP"], "trades_per_day": 1100, "ts": "2026-05-28T00:00:01Z", "win_rate_pct": 17.0}
{"author": "claude(gce)", "cache_id": "gs://market-data-0998ac51/feats_sub60/{SYM}/{YYYY-MM-DD}.npz + raw/book/exchange=BINANCE_FUTURES/symbol={SYM}/dt={DATE} (native ts mid, 100ms forward path)", "commission_loss_pct": 0.07, "commission_win_pct": 0.04, "data_source": "cryptolake", "date_range_end": "2026-05-08", "date_range_start": "2025-05-09", "embargo": "60s", "ev_per_trade_pct": -0.04, "experiment_id": "subs60-20260528_finepath_continuous", "fee_regime": "MAKER_FIRST", "git_commit": "3099e7d3adaf08a72c885fcc24186e47e6f29698", "hypothesis_id": "HD2", "kind": "strategy", "label_def": "entry=native book mid at decision ts; forward path = book mid at ts+[100,200,..,60000]ms (searchsorted, ffill); first-passage TP/SL; 1s path = every 10th step for bias comparison.", "model_family": "grid_only", "n_samples": 13000000, "n_trades": 50000, "note": "Levers #4 (100ms fine path) + #2 (selectivity) results. (1) FINE-PATH: the 100ms book path recovers ~1.5x gross vs the 1s coarse grid - the 1s grid undercounts intra-second TP touches ~30-45%; real but does not close the maker gap. (2) SELECTIVITY: even at the top-0.2% combined vol x dir conviction (~30 trades/day, the user's '>=10 trades/day' target), maker stays -2..-6bp while VIP0 reaches +1.0..+3.6bp. Net: selectivity + fine-path each add gross but neither alone lifts deployable maker above the floor - consistent with the binding lever being vol-model precision (see subs60_gridsim_deployable). CONTINUOUS surface only (EV-vs-conviction decile curve, no discrete pass/fail gate; CLAUDE.md + user constraint). ev_per_trade_pct=-0.04% is the maker top-0.2% midpoint; scalars representative, per-symbol + exact counts in VM stdout - repro_cmd reproduces. n_samples = day-stride-18/dec-stride-4 subsample used for the 100ms rebuild.", "params": {"argmax_config": {"reward_risk": 6.0, "sl": 0.05, "to_s": 45, "tp": 0.3}, "conviction": "combined ridge|move| rank + logreg dir rank (continuous, no gate)", "ev_per_trade_bp_top0p2pct": {"VIP0": [1.0, 3.6], "maker": [-6.0, -2.0]}, "fill_latency_ms": 150, "fine_vs_1s_gross_recovery": 1.5, "horizon_steps": 600, "selective_top_0p2pct_trades_per_day": 30, "selectivity_percentiles": [0.9, 0.99, 0.998], "step_ms": 100}, "pnl_gross_pct": 0.05, "repro_cmd": "GCE 32-vCPU europe-west1; python3 scripts/subs60_finepath.py --symbols <SYM> --day-stride 18 --dec-stride 4", "setup": "FINE-PATH (100ms) economics + CONTINUOUS conviction surface (no discrete >=13bp gate). Rebuilds the forward path at 100ms resolution from the RAW book (600 steps = 60s) vs the coarse 1s decision-grid mid that undercounts intra-second TP touches; runs grid_sim; characterizes EV as a continuous function of combined vol x dir conviction percentile (ridge-predict |move| ranked continuously + logreg dir conviction). Also resamples a 1s path from the same book to quantify the coarse-path bias. Selective tail at top-10%/1%/0.2% percentiles. Levers #4 (fine path) + #2 (selectivity) executed here.", "split_method": "honest_val_test", "status": "exploratory", "symbols": ["BTC-USDT-PERP", "ETH-USDT-PERP", "BNB-USDT-PERP", "SOL-USDT-PERP", "XRP-USDT-PERP", "DOGE-USDT-PERP", "LINK-USDT-PERP", "LTC-USDT-PERP"], "trades_per_day": 30, "ts": "2026-05-28T00:00:02Z", "win_rate_pct": 22.0}
