er everywhere; at top0.05% conviction taker gross +5.64bp(wr0.52), maker_off0 +4.42, cancel-on-toxic +2.73 (no help); broad gate all negative. CAVEAT (critical): the positive fine-tune/grid/policy numbers carry test=val inflation (best-val early-stop + A-gate threshold both chosen on the SAME test set) -> UPPER BOUNDS, not deploy-grade; t_day~12-21 implausibly high. Net honest read: GRU is the right model; deployable net>0 only at high conviction + TAKER entry at STANDARD Binance fees (NO VIP0/zero-fee tier exists; maker-maker 0.04% RT is the best real tariff); passive maker entry structurally loses to adverse selection. Pre-deploy: CPCV/walk-forward with val!=test (pending).", "params": {"gru_cell": {"cell": "stub(GRU)", "A": {"d1": 128, "n1": 2, "d2": 64, "n2": 1}, "B": {"d1": 64, "n1": 2, "d2": 32, "n2": 1}, "B2_finetune": {"lr": 0.0003, "patience": 4, "max_ep": 30}}, "A_params": 263297, "B_params": 70745, "A_vol_auc": {"DOGE": 0.7817, "ETH": 0.818, "LINK": 0.7417}, "A_prec_at_0p2pct": {"DOGE": 0.623, "ETH": 0.69, "LINK": 0.675}, "A_best_ep_of_5": {"DOGE": 4, "ETH": 4, "LINK": 5}, "B_pool": {"cap_at_10pct_bp": 4.682, "cap_at_20pct_bp": 4.116, "dacc_at_10pct": 0.612, "best_ep": 6}, "B2_eth_finetune": {"best_ep": 17, "exec_gross_bp": 4.98, "net_mm_bp": 0.98, "wr": 0.615, "net_mm_by_conviction_bp": {"top20pct": 6.23, "top10pct": 7.6, "top5pct": 9.0, "top2pct": 9.45}}, "grid_rr_mid_entry_top0p2pct_net_mm_bp": {"DOGE": {"rr": 22.8, "net": -1.13, "wr": 0.16}, "ETH": {"rr": 1.78, "net": -1.39, "wr": 0.55}, "LINK": {"rr": 6.45, "net": -1.02, "wr": 0.55}}, "maker_sim_eth_hold60_gross_bp": {"touch_qm0": -1.97, "queue_qm1": -2.44, "queue_qm2": -2.48, "fill_rate": {"touch": 0.95, "queue": 0.91}, "wr": 0.45, "n": 96996, "days": 116}, "entry_policy_sweep_eth_gross_bp": {"taker_immediate": {"all": -0.26, "top0.2pct": 1.56, "top0.05pct": 5.64}, "maker_off0_q0": {"all": -0.98, "top0.2pct": 0.42, "top0.05pct": 4.42}, "maker_cancel_toxic_p90": {"all": -1.03, "top0.2pct": -0.34, "to