NEST CASCADE (gate by Model-A PREDICTION top-g% x B side, net after 4bp): argmax cell per symbol -> LTC +2.01bp, LINK +1.23bp (both hold/TOUCH, A-top0.2%, dir_acc .54-.56, ~12-18 trd/day) go NET-POSITIVE; XRP -0.78, DOGE -1.10 near breakeven; BNB -2.86, ETH -4.28, BTC -4.71(RR6/touch top5%), SOL -5.02 stay negative. SURFACE SHAPE that maximizes maker alpha: touch>>queue (passive fill on first touch far less adverse than queue-clear), EXTREME selectivity (A-top0.2%), hold-60s>RR (except BTC RR6 wider). Model A (vol) strong everywhere; the BINDING constraint on net is adverse selection on passive maker fills, not direction skill. CAVEAT: per-symbol argmax is a MAX over ~30 cells (cfg x qm x selectivity) ON THE TEST surface -> selection-over-conditions optimism (val!=test and A-threshold are train-only and honest, but cfg/qm/sel pick is on test); LTC/LINK net-positive cells are CANDIDATE CONDITIONS requiring OOS (walk-forward) confirmation, NOT a deploy verdict. Full grid -> SURFACE.json. Compares to GRU (RESEARCH_LOG s14): same vol-AUC class; this run adds the maker-realistic-label training + honest A-gated cascade.", "params": {"B_cfg": "hold-60s", "B_qm": 1.0, "feats": 71, "n_test_per_sym": {"BNB": 745512, "BTC": 1215312, "DOGE": 711654, "ETH": 1217889, "LINK": 730001, "LTC": 717676, "SOL": 713416, "XRP": 851294}, "nf_rate": 0.05, "optuna_trials": 40, "search_cap": 600000, "seed": 0, "split_fracs": [0.65, 0.68, 0.85]}, "repro_cmd": "python3 subs60_makerlabel_build.py --symbols ALL ; python3 subs60_xgb_makerlabel.py --symbols ALL --trials 40 --seed 0 ; python3 subs60_xgb_surface.py --symbols BNB BTC DOGE ETH LINK LTC SOL XRP", "setup": "XGBoost 2x2 cascade (A per-symbol vol-gate + B pooled direction) on sub-60s MAKER-REALISTIC adverse-selection labels; Optuna(val) HP tuning on train-subsample, final fit on full train; honest A-pred-gated cascade surface computed offline from saved per-sample preds.", "split_method": "honest_val_test", "status": "exploratory", "symbol