t the apred 5% gate for pure-maker?", "split_method": "honest_val_test", "status": "exploratory", "supersedes": null, "symbols": ["BTC-USDT-PERP", "LINK-USDT-PERP"], "ts": "2026-06-02T10:25:00Z"}
